4T7] (dia_id: D14:7)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, here's a pic I took. It was so awesome - I loved how the crowd was into it. These moments are why I love my job.\n[Image caption: a photography of a crowd of people at a concert with their hands up]\n[S14T8] (dia_id: D14:8)\n\nDave: The energy in that pic is awesome! Seeing everyone with their hands up must have been really cool. It's great when your passion brings joy to others!\n[S14T9] (dia_id: D14:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, that was buzzing! It's moments like these that make me so proud and motivated. I'm all about spreading joy with my art. So, how's your project going?\n[S14T10] (dia_id: D14:10)\n\nDave: Yeah, the project is going great! Here's a pic of the car I'm restoring. It's pretty cool seeing it go from a beat-up mess to a real beauty.\n[Image caption: a photo of a car with a broken engine in the woods]\n[S14T11] (dia_id: D14:11)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave, that car is going to look amazing when you're done. How long do you think it will take to restore it?\n[S14T12] (dia_id: D14:12)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Fingers crossed it'll be all fixed up by the end of next month. Lots of elbow grease but it'll be worth the transformation.\n[S14T13] (dia_id: D14:13)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave, I'm really excited to see the end result of your hard work! You've got some serious talent!\n[S14T14] (dia_id: D14:14)\n\nDave: Thanks, Cal! Your support means a lot to me.\n[S14T15] (dia_id: D14:15)\n\nCalvin: You got this, Dave! I'm always here for you. Seeing your enthusiasm is amazing. Keep growing, buddy. It'll be worth it! Good luck with that. See ya!\n[S14T16] (dia_id: D14:16)","text_sha256":"a08fa6b63122fce2db9861ffebd8bcf53c40e44e91e50d1b9ea2ea5f95d9811b","timestamp":"2023-08-14T00:35:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D3:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":31,"line_start":30,"source_locators":["[S3T7]"],"text_sha256":"3b5882ccb2181b4c0bc85727fd13751062